    <string name="settings_behaviour_body">He is intangible out there: every tap goes straight through him, so nothing he floats over is ever blocked. Feeding and petting happen in his box on the Home tab — that is the one place he can be touched.</string>
    <string name="buzz_when_he_runs">Buzz when he runs</string>
    <string name="settings_battery_body">Phones put background apps to sleep to save battery — Samsung especially. If Ghostly stops floating after an hour or two, set his battery usage to Unrestricted and turn off \"Put app to sleep\" for him.</string>
    <string name="settings_account_body">Signing in keeps your ghost if you change phone, and keeps his token balance honest. He works exactly the same without it.</string>
